1
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,919
Korean?

2
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,120
Chinese.

3
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,360
Then, Chinese,

4
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,479
can you buy me a drink?

5
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:28,759
Mister Chinese.

6
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,639
Take it easy. I want to ask you something first.

7
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:35,719
Are you a cop?

8
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,680
Of course not.

9
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:40,919
Do you know these two in the photo?

10
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,680
You don't want to mess with these people.

11
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:45,520
You'd better stay away from them.

12
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,240
I think you misunderstand.

13
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,879
I'm looking to buy some goods from them.

14
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,360
You know what I mean?

15
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,879
Sorry, I don't know them.

16
00:03:01,599 --> 00:03:02,560
Just say the word,

17
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:04,240
and all this money is yours.

18
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,240
Hello, sir.

19
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,159
How may I help you?

20
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:28,840
I was wondering,

21
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,960
is your boss named Qin Mu?

22
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:33,039
Yes, but he's not here.

23
00:03:34,159 --> 00:03:35,400
When will he be back?

24
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:37,719
He's been away on business recently.

25
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:39,800
None of us have seen him either.

26
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,639
May I ask what this is regarding?

27
00:03:44,039 --> 00:03:44,879
How about this?

28
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,280
Leave me your number,

29
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,400
and when he gets back,

30
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,400
I'll have him call you. How does that sound?

31
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,360
No, that's not necessary.

32
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,919
I'll come back later.

33
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:54,080
All right, thank you very much.

34
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,360
Thank you.

35
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:04,479
I never told you anything.

36
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,480
Where is Tian Xin?

37
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:58,279
Kill me, and you'll never see her again.

38
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,480
Talk!

39
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:23,399
Freeze!

40
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,680
Don't move!

41
00:05:25,519 --> 00:05:27,079
What are you doing? Nobody move!

42
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,399
Stop right now, or I'll shoot!

43
00:05:37,519 --> 00:05:39,879
Don't run, or I'll shoot!

44
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:43,040
You, put your hands up!

45
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:57,720
Hungry, aren't you?

46
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,439
Do you really think you can hold me captive forever?

47
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:06,680
I've already found Qin Mu.

48
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,800
I'll see my brother soon.

49
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:10,040
Once I meet up with him,

50
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:12,600
you won't have to suffer through hard times with me anymore.

51
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,920
You still don't understand, do you?

52
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:18,000
No matter what you do,

53
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,560
I will never be with you.

54
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:20,959
I know.

55
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,879
For someone like you, in my heart,

56
00:07:23,879 --> 00:07:25,480
there's only hatred, nothing else.

57
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,120
I know.

58
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,319
I never expected you to love me.

59
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,160
As long as you're by my side,

60
00:07:32,879 --> 00:07:34,279
that's all I need.

61
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,079
Come on, have some food.

62
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,079
Come on.

63
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,160
Take it.

64
00:07:47,519 --> 00:07:49,680
Do you have any idea how selfish you're being?

65
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,199
Something that everyone else understands...

66
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,519
Why can't you get it through your head?

67
00:07:57,279 --> 00:07:58,600
I really don't.

68
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:03,279
I understand that you hate me.

69
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,360
After all, I'm not a cop.

70
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,680
I'm a drug dealer.

71
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,680
If fate gave me another chance,

72
00:08:08,839 --> 00:08:10,000
I would definitely choose to be a good person.

73
00:08:10,199 --> 00:08:12,040
To be the kind of person you'd like.

74
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:15,600
Too bad I can't turn back time.

75
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,920
In everyone's eyes,

76
00:08:22,399 --> 00:08:24,600
I'm just a vile, unforgivable villain.

77
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:30,720
As long as you're here,

78
00:08:31,519 --> 00:08:34,080
a piece of beauty remains in my life.

79
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:37,159
I'd rather fight the entire world

80
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:40,080
than stand by and watch

81
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,559
that beauty get ripped away by someone else.

82
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,840
If you won't let me go,

83
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,679
I'll die right in front of you.

84
00:08:57,279 --> 00:08:58,480
Dying is easy.

85
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:02,200
Have you considered your cop boyfriend, though?

86
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:05,399
Back in Nanhai,

87
00:09:05,399 --> 00:09:07,039
we really didn't have a chance to strike.

88
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:09,720
But now he's come here.

89
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,600
As soon as I see my brother,

90
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:15,519
his life will be in our hands.

91
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:21,399
What did you say?

92
00:09:23,399 --> 00:09:24,799
Li Xiao came to Country M?

93
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,960
Have you seen him?

94
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,600
Where is he?

95
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,440
I have to go find him.

96
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,080
Let go of me! He came here for me!

97
00:09:35,159 --> 00:09:35,919
Let go of me!

98
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,320
If you dare take half a step out of this room,

99
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,600
I'll make sure he dies a miserable death.

100
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:55,360
I'll go get you something more to eat.

101
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:58,759
You can scream for help or try to run.

102
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,559
It's up to you.

103
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,440
But let me remind you,

104
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:06,120
I can take Li Xiao down with me at any moment.

105
00:10:38,519 --> 00:10:40,080
Chinese, you can go.

106
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,960
What on earth happened last night?

107
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,519
I saw Li Qiang last night.

108
00:11:32,279 --> 00:11:33,559
Li Qiang is in Country M.

109
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,000
I went to Qin Mu's bar

110
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,279
to investigate Professor Du's case.

111
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,159
I didn't expect to turn around and see him.

112
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,759
Unfortunately, he got away.

113
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,200
When Ma Jingrong left Country M,

114
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:49,200
he specifically instructed Qin Mu to assist Li Qiang.

115
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,440
We have an inside man close to Qin Mu.

116
00:11:51,759 --> 00:11:54,000
As soon as Li Qiang meets up with Qin Mu,

117
00:11:54,039 --> 00:11:55,600
we'll immediately notify Country M's police

118
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:56,799
to make the arrest and rescue Tian Xin.

119
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,519
Everything was under our control.

120
00:11:58,759 --> 00:11:59,600
You were so reckless.

121
00:11:59,759 --> 00:12:01,240
You could easily spook him, you know?

122
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,320
Li Qiang will definitely go back to Qin Mu's bar.

123
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:08,519
I want you to post people to stake out the bar.

124
00:12:10,559 --> 00:12:12,559
As Interpol officers in Country M,

125
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,759
we have no law enforcement authority.

126
00:12:15,919 --> 00:12:17,639
Then have Country M's police send people!

127
00:12:18,399 --> 00:12:19,200
We can't just wait around here

128
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:20,200
and do nothing, right?

129
00:12:21,559 --> 00:12:22,080
Get in the car.

130
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:34,399
We still can't be sure

131
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,559
whether anyone in Country M's police

132
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,000
is actually working for Theerade.

133
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,960
If Theerade finds out Country M's police

134
00:12:39,159 --> 00:12:40,519
are already targeting Qin Mu,

135
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,159
he's bound to get suspicious.

136
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:43,639
We can't let this one thing

137
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,759
jeopardize the entire operation!

138
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:46,000
I'm asking you to be patient.

139
00:12:47,679 --> 00:12:49,320
Tian Xin is in Li Qiang's hands right now!

140
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:51,120
How can I be patient?!

141
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,240
What is she to you?

142
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,360
She's my woman.

143
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:09,279
No wonder you said last time that Li Qiang kidnapped Tian Xin

144
00:13:09,519 --> 00:13:10,480
just to get revenge on you.

145
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:13,440
But have you considered one thing?

146
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,080
If you care about Tian Xin's safety,

147
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:17,120
you ought to understand

148
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:19,120
that without a foolproof plan,

149
00:13:19,279 --> 00:13:20,240
not only will you fail to save her,

150
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,559
you'll actually end up getting her killed.

151
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,159
How is the situation with Professor Du?

152
00:13:34,759 --> 00:13:36,399
The criminals holding Professor Du hostage

153
00:13:36,759 --> 00:13:38,080
are staying in Golden Harbor Fishing Village.

154
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:39,360
Once we track them down,

155
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:41,080
we should be able to find Professor Du.

156
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,519
That'd be great.

157
00:13:45,679 --> 00:13:47,080
As long as we catch those two thugs,

158
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,399
we'll have the grounds and leverage

159
00:13:48,759 --> 00:13:50,879
to have Country M's police work with ours

160
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,519
and launch a joint operation, right?

161
00:13:53,279 --> 00:13:53,639
Look,

162
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,120
we have our own insider

163
00:13:56,279 --> 00:13:57,919
close to Qin Mu, right?

164
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,840
We'll definitely get word right away

165
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,200
on Li Qiang and Tian Xin.

166
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,919
Just be patient, okay?

167
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:10,240
I'm joining the Golden Harbor operation too.

168
00:14:13,919 --> 00:14:15,039
Look, about that...

169
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,200
I'll do my best to coordinate it.

170
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,559
But standard protocol dictates that

171
00:14:17,919 --> 00:14:19,639
without top-level authorization,

172
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,519
you can only be present

173
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:22,799
when Country M's police make the arrest.

174
00:14:22,919 --> 00:14:23,840
You cannot engage in the operation,

175
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,679
let alone carry a firearm, all right?

176
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,120
I understand all that.

177
00:14:27,279 --> 00:14:29,080
But right now, our compatriot's life is on the line,

178
00:14:29,279 --> 00:14:30,480
not some international protocol.

179
00:15:32,399 --> 00:15:33,919
Once we capture Ayutai and Shaba,

180
00:15:34,399 --> 00:15:35,399
we can confirm

181
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:38,720
whether Professor Du Guangming is in Piyazi's hands.

182
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,279
When that time comes,

183
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,679
we at Interpol

184
00:15:42,879 --> 00:15:44,879
will urge Country M's police to launch a rescue.

185
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:50,879
I'm just afraid that by the time the rescue begins,

186
00:15:51,039 --> 00:15:52,000
it'll already be too late.

187
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:54,039
I know you're anxious,

188
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,519
but we are in Country M.

189
00:15:59,639 --> 00:16:03,279
Although Country M's police

190
00:16:03,399 --> 00:16:05,200
have agreed with Chinese police

191
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:06,720
on a joint operation,

192
00:16:06,879 --> 00:16:09,960
without solid evidence

193
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:12,720
against Piyazi and Theerade,

194
00:16:13,159 --> 00:16:16,399
and before locating their drug base,

195
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:22,320
we can't authorize you to join the arrest

196
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,320
and interrogation operations.

197
00:16:28,879 --> 00:16:32,240
I see. I understand your position.

198
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,559
But the problem right now is

199
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,600
that our fellow Chinese citizen

200
00:16:34,759 --> 00:16:36,600
faces a threat to his life in Country M.

201
00:16:36,759 --> 00:16:37,720
As a Chinese police officer,

202
00:16:37,879 --> 00:16:39,159
I can't just stand by and watch.

203
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:40,480
I hope you can understand that.

204
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:47,120
I can approve you joining the team

205
00:16:47,679 --> 00:16:49,879
at the scene,

206
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:52,120
but you cannot carry a firearm

207
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:55,000
or participate in the actual raid.

208
00:16:59,879 --> 00:17:00,480
Fine.

209
00:17:02,879 --> 00:17:04,559
Then if you do capture

210
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,480
those two criminals,

211
00:17:05,559 --> 00:17:07,079
how quickly do you think

212
00:17:07,279 --> 00:17:08,759
you can get intel on Professor Du?

213
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:10,000
And another question:

214
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,480
If the suspects refuse to cooperate,

215
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:12,359
what solutions

216
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:13,319
would you have then?

217
00:17:14,519 --> 00:17:15,640
As a fellow officer,

218
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:18,279
Officer Li, you should know well

219
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:21,519
that we can only do our best.

220
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,960
If the suspects refuse to confess,

221
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,599
or if the cartel

222
00:17:26,119 --> 00:17:28,039
hires lawyers for them,

223
00:17:28,319 --> 00:17:32,920
there's little we can do.

224
00:17:33,079 --> 00:17:34,200
But let me reiterate:

225
00:17:34,359 --> 00:17:36,440
We will certainly do our utmost.

226
00:17:40,279 --> 00:17:41,119
All right.

227
00:17:44,559 --> 00:17:45,480
Then I have one more question.

228
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,519
Once we get information

229
00:17:47,559 --> 00:17:48,160
out of the suspects,

230
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,799
can we immediately launch a rescue?

231
00:17:50,759 --> 00:17:52,599
We first have to determine

232
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:55,480
where Professor Du is held.

233
00:17:55,759 --> 00:17:59,000
Only then can we plan the deployment.

234
00:17:59,759 --> 00:18:00,480
And before that,

235
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:03,039
we must report everything

236
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,720
to the local police department.

237
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:07,400
You must realize how sensitive this case is.

238
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:10,240
We're dealing with a global syndicate,

239
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,960
and their operational base

240
00:18:12,119 --> 00:18:14,759
is in Jiechan State's lawless territory.

241
00:18:15,079 --> 00:18:17,720
Any rescue mission must receive

242
00:18:18,039 --> 00:18:22,240
top approval from the national police.

243
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,039
But the problem right now is—

244
00:18:24,039 --> 00:18:24,720
The problem right now is,

245
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:26,839
Professor Du's life is at risk every second.

246
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:27,759
Yes.

247
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:31,519
He may have already met with foul play.

248
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:34,000
To the questions you asked,

249
00:18:34,079 --> 00:18:35,400
no one can give you a definitive answer,

250
00:18:35,599 --> 00:18:37,240
and I can only go by the book.

251
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,440
Move!

252
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:37,000
Sir, Shaba has escaped.

253
00:21:09,599 --> 00:21:11,000
I like the way you do things.

254
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:47,519
In Professor Du's medical records,

255
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:48,960
his allergy history is clearly documented.

256
00:21:49,839 --> 00:21:51,319
There's no way he didn't know.

257
00:21:53,559 --> 00:21:54,640
You mean Professor Du

258
00:21:54,799 --> 00:21:55,960
didn't tell the doctor the truth?

259
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,799
He's deliberately trying to die!

260
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,079
Professor Du would never tolerate

261
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,119
associating with those drug traffickers.

262
00:22:07,599 --> 00:22:09,759
Once Piyazi loses patience with him,

263
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:11,240
he could kill him at any moment.

264
00:22:12,119 --> 00:22:13,359
We don't have much time left.

265
00:22:18,039 --> 00:22:19,000
Piyazi's headquarters

266
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:21,079
is located where multiple borders meet.

267
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:23,079
Due to historical reasons,

268
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:26,079
it's become a lawless tri-border area.

269
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,839
Meisuo Town, where Professor Du is held,

270
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:32,640
is within Piyazi's sphere of influence,

271
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:33,880
but it's actually

272
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,599
one of your Chinese border towns.

273
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:37,960
All right.

274
00:22:39,359 --> 00:22:40,680
Since it's a Chinese town,

275
00:22:41,559 --> 00:22:43,240
I'll report to leadership

276
00:22:43,839 --> 00:22:45,240
and launch a rescue operation.

277
00:23:32,359 --> 00:23:33,079
How is he?

278
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:34,519
Just physical injuries.

279
00:23:35,319 --> 00:23:36,079
Nothing too serious.

280
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:40,880
He had complications earlier, though.

281
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:43,440
It will take some time

282
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:44,680
for his body to recover.

283
00:23:47,559 --> 00:23:48,559
As long as he's fine.

284
00:23:50,319 --> 00:23:52,119
As long as he's fine.

285
00:23:52,119 --> 00:23:54,759
Being fine means he's still alive.

286
00:23:57,039 --> 00:23:57,839
And being alive is all that matters.

287
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:01,279
Since you're alive,

288
00:24:02,039 --> 00:24:03,920
let's talk about

289
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:06,400
topics for the living.

290
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:10,079
Scholars pursue knowledge

291
00:24:10,559 --> 00:24:12,200
so their work

292
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:14,000
can be recognized by humanity.

293
00:24:17,359 --> 00:24:19,119
It's their greatest honor.

294
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:23,400
I once gave you a platform,

295
00:24:23,960 --> 00:24:25,519
yet you didn't appreciate it.

296
00:24:30,759 --> 00:24:32,519
You've already died once.

297
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:36,480
Cherish this second chance at life.

298
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:41,000
I want news in three days.

299
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:42,480
Notify me then.

300
00:24:42,839 --> 00:24:43,519
Three days?

301
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,720
I can't guarantee

302
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:47,960
his body will fully recover by then.

303
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:49,599
You can.

304
00:24:49,839 --> 00:24:51,279
What I need is his brain,

305
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,440
not his body.

306
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:55,960
Have you thought about moving in with me?

307
00:24:57,839 --> 00:24:59,799
A lot of people in town need me.

308
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:02,000
I can't leave with you.

309
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:05,519
I need you more.

310
00:25:21,359 --> 00:25:22,720
Have someone guard him.

311
00:25:23,440 --> 00:25:25,519
Take him away in three days.

312
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:26,240
Understood.

313
00:25:26,599 --> 00:25:28,119
Brother Dong, Four-Legged Snake is back.

314
00:25:29,559 --> 00:25:30,400
My brother is back.

315
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:32,359
A-Nan is back, Brother Dong.

316
00:25:34,839 --> 00:25:36,440
I only have three days

317
00:25:36,839 --> 00:25:38,079
to hurry and treat you.

318
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:40,519
As for the allergic reaction,

319
00:25:41,759 --> 00:25:43,039
I don't want it happening again.

320
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,400
If you die,

321
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:49,000
my clinic is finished too.

322
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:51,720
Dr. Chen,

323
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:54,400
you know who they are.

324
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:57,359
Why are you still working for them?

325
00:26:00,440 --> 00:26:01,839
If I didn't help them,

326
00:26:02,880 --> 00:26:04,279
would you even be alive?

327
00:26:05,119 --> 00:26:06,519
I'm a doctor.

328
00:26:07,759 --> 00:26:09,960
My only job is to treat patients.

329
00:26:10,759 --> 00:26:13,599
I don't think about anything else.

330
00:26:14,279 --> 00:26:17,240
Many people in town need me.

331
00:26:17,279 --> 00:26:18,880
I can't give up on them

332
00:26:19,839 --> 00:26:21,000
just because of Piyazi.

333
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:34,480
I'd still advise you to stay alive.

334
00:26:35,359 --> 00:26:36,039
As long as you're alive,

335
00:26:37,839 --> 00:26:39,279
there's always hope.

336
00:27:01,319 --> 00:27:02,400
Regarding your proposal,

337
00:27:02,799 --> 00:27:04,240
I briefed the chief.

338
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:05,799
He approved it.

339
00:27:07,839 --> 00:27:10,000
After reviewing it, we've decided

340
00:27:10,799 --> 00:27:13,440
Capt. Lu will pose as drug lord Shen Xinru

341
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:16,119
and approach Ma Jingrong with you.

342
00:27:16,759 --> 00:27:18,880
Also, this is Xia Yang,

343
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:20,759
a drug expert from the Provincial Narcotics Unit.

344
00:27:20,799 --> 00:27:22,279
He can use very simple tools

345
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,880
to determine drug purity.

346
00:27:24,279 --> 00:27:26,240
He will be assisting Captain Lu this time.

347
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:29,960
So where is the real Shen Xinru now?

348
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:32,279
She's already detained in isolation.

349
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:33,279
Don't worry.

350
00:27:33,599 --> 00:27:34,599
Before the operation is over,

351
00:27:34,759 --> 00:27:36,480
not a single word will leak out.

352
00:27:38,720 --> 00:27:41,279
In that case, let's do it.

353
00:27:44,240 --> 00:27:44,880
Let's eat.

354
00:28:26,960 --> 00:28:28,480
Welcome to Jiechan State.

355
00:29:28,119 --> 00:29:29,400
Let them through.

356
00:29:42,839 --> 00:29:43,720
Hello, Boss.

357
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:46,599
You're back. Good work.

358
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:49,400
Don't just stand there. Sit down.

359
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:53,799
Why didn't A-Nan come back?

360
00:29:54,839 --> 00:29:55,559
Where's my brother?

361
00:29:56,519 --> 00:29:59,480
Weren't you supposed to meet in Jiangyang?

362
00:30:05,119 --> 00:30:06,160
Nothing to say?

363
00:30:06,279 --> 00:30:07,079
Cat got your tongue?

364
00:30:07,559 --> 00:30:08,240
Speak up!

365
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:13,000
Something went wrong.

366
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,000
Was it the cops?

367
00:30:30,359 --> 00:30:32,079
Or did our rivals take him?

368
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:36,079
Speak!

369
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:41,039
Say something!

370
00:30:44,400 --> 00:30:45,519
Brother Nan... he...

371
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,799
What did you say? I didn't hear you.

372
00:30:58,039 --> 00:30:59,839
Brother Nan is dead.

373
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:02,519
Explain yourself right now!

374
00:31:02,559 --> 00:31:03,200
Brother Dong...

375
00:31:03,920 --> 00:31:04,480
Boss...

376
00:31:05,119 --> 00:31:06,680
Brother Dong, this isn't Fourth Brother's fault.

377
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:07,880
Cheng Weimin did it.

378
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,279
He teamed up with Qin Mu.

379
00:31:09,599 --> 00:31:11,200
Qin Mu hired hitmen for him from Country M.

380
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:13,200
Where's Cheng Weimin? Where is he?

381
00:31:14,039 --> 00:31:15,759
When we met Cheng Weimin,

382
00:31:16,359 --> 00:31:17,559
the cops ambushed us.

383
00:31:17,799 --> 00:31:19,640
Brother Nan shot him dead.

384
00:31:19,839 --> 00:31:21,079
What about the hitmen?

385
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:25,440
We didn't see them.

386
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:27,200
But lately, Ma Jingrong

387
00:31:27,319 --> 00:31:29,000
has been in close contact with Country M.

388
00:31:29,319 --> 00:31:30,640
It's Qin Mu.

389
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:33,319
A few days ago, Qin Mu and his men

390
00:31:33,519 --> 00:31:34,720
suddenly left Country M.

391
00:31:35,319 --> 00:31:36,039
Brother Nan's death...

392
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:37,920
Qin Mu and his men likely did it.

393
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,680
You went out together.

394
00:31:42,319 --> 00:31:43,519
You came back alive,

395
00:31:45,119 --> 00:31:46,119
but my brother didn't.

396
00:32:11,359 --> 00:32:14,160
So many people risk their lives

397
00:32:14,359 --> 00:32:16,240
smuggling it inland from Jiechan State,

398
00:32:17,119 --> 00:32:19,839
only to sell it off

399
00:32:19,839 --> 00:32:20,599
bag by tiny bag.

400
00:32:21,359 --> 00:32:24,519
The risk and reward are totally out of proportion.

401
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:29,440
So if we're doing this, let's go all the way.

402
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:34,519
I have sales channels in 13 provinces.

403
00:32:35,119 --> 00:32:36,640
No matter how much product you have,

404
00:32:37,279 --> 00:32:38,599
I can take it all.

405
00:32:40,599 --> 00:32:41,519
However,

406
00:32:42,880 --> 00:32:44,759
I need a reliable supplier.

407
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:50,759
As for this Theerade you mentioned,

408
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:52,960
I've never heard of him.

409
00:32:53,599 --> 00:32:57,880
I don't know how he measures up

410
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:58,559
against Piyazi.

411
00:32:59,119 --> 00:33:03,440
So I'd like to ask you, Mr. Ma,

412
00:33:04,519 --> 00:33:06,079
to see if you have what it takes

413
00:33:07,319 --> 00:33:08,920
to do business with me.

414
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:13,359
My product is top quality.

415
00:33:19,839 --> 00:33:20,519
Mr. Ma,

416
00:33:22,359 --> 00:33:23,960
product from Jiechan State

417
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:25,799
is never bad.

418
00:33:30,279 --> 00:33:33,440
Yet you can only supply heroin right now.

419
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:37,640
The synthetic drug market is booming,

420
00:33:37,759 --> 00:33:40,880
yet you have zero advantage in that area.

421
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:44,279
I've always been pragmatic

422
00:33:44,559 --> 00:33:45,599
and straightforward.

423
00:33:46,559 --> 00:33:48,599
All I want is a single supplier

424
00:33:48,839 --> 00:33:50,680
for a steady, long-term supply.

425
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:52,720
High quality,

426
00:33:53,519 --> 00:33:55,440
a diverse selection,

427
00:33:56,440 --> 00:34:00,720
and above all, stability and security.

428
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:10,400
New products and No. 4

429
00:34:11,199 --> 00:34:13,320
each have their own market demand.

430
00:34:14,639 --> 00:34:16,800
Of course, if you're interested, Mr. Shen,

431
00:34:17,079 --> 00:34:18,800
we can join forces.

432
00:34:19,559 --> 00:34:22,679
I have the manpower and the capital.

433
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:24,760
There's nothing I can't do.

434
00:34:26,039 --> 00:34:28,400
If what you say is true, Mr. Ma,

435
00:34:28,559 --> 00:34:30,079
nothing would please me more.

436
00:34:30,960 --> 00:34:33,719
So I'd like to sign

437
00:34:34,039 --> 00:34:36,360
an exclusive contract with Mr. Theerade.

438
00:34:36,719 --> 00:34:39,239
Meaning that only I

439
00:34:39,760 --> 00:34:42,000
can get product from you.

440
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:44,199
Can you do that?

441
00:34:45,519 --> 00:34:46,559
Not a problem.

442
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:52,800
Mr. Ma, oh, Mr. Ma...

443
00:34:53,760 --> 00:34:55,119
It's our first meeting.

444
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:58,079
Don't make promises you can't keep.

445
00:34:59,320 --> 00:35:01,119
Not that I doubt your capability,

446
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:02,880
but I think

447
00:35:04,239 --> 00:35:05,679
for a deal this big,

448
00:35:06,079 --> 00:35:07,360
you should head back

449
00:35:07,519 --> 00:35:09,360
and discuss it thoroughly with your boss.

450
00:35:10,039 --> 00:35:13,039
Besides, I also really want to meet

451
00:35:13,239 --> 00:35:14,360
this Mr. Theerade,

452
00:35:14,679 --> 00:35:17,239
to talk with him face-to-face.

453
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:21,880
Mr. Theerade never handles

454
00:35:22,079 --> 00:35:23,199
business matters in person.

455
00:35:29,639 --> 00:35:31,239
If Mr. Theerade can't even show

456
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:33,920
this much sincerity,

457
00:35:34,239 --> 00:35:36,119
then I don't think there's any need

458
00:35:36,119 --> 00:35:37,679
for us to waste each other's time.

459
00:35:40,119 --> 00:35:43,079
Besides, I doubt you're the only ones

460
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:45,320
who can supply product from Jiechan State.

461
00:35:52,119 --> 00:35:53,679
In that case, Mr. Shen,

462
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:58,840
I can try to arrange it.

463
00:36:01,199 --> 00:36:02,039
Good.

464
00:36:05,119 --> 00:36:06,400
I trust you, Mr. Ma.

465
00:36:07,480 --> 00:36:10,559
I'll be waiting for your good news.

466
00:36:11,039 --> 00:36:11,679
All right.

467
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:34,480
Why didn't you make him stay?

468
00:36:35,599 --> 00:36:37,119
I thought he was looking for trouble.

469
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:43,719
You knew Mr. Ma's brother could arrive any minute.

470
00:36:44,119 --> 00:36:45,199
Why didn't you give them a heads-up?

471
00:36:45,519 --> 00:36:48,559
Boss, I left in such a rush that I forgot.

472
00:36:49,320 --> 00:36:50,360
What good are you?

473
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:53,119
Tell me, what can you actually do?

474
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:54,519
You can't even handle something this simple!

475
00:36:55,199 --> 00:36:56,880
The man said he'd come back.

476
00:36:57,639 --> 00:36:58,639
He seemed to be in a real rush.

477
00:36:58,800 --> 00:36:59,960
Probably in the next couple of days.

478
00:37:05,719 --> 00:37:06,400
You.

479
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:10,599
Keep an eye out at all times.

480
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:12,719
We need an answer for Mr. Ma when he gets back.

481
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:13,719
Understood, Boss.

482
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:20,880
Boss, this guy insisted on seeing you.

483
00:37:26,599 --> 00:37:27,679
So you're Li Qiang.

484
00:37:31,719 --> 00:37:33,000
And you're Qin Mu.

485
00:37:44,400 --> 00:37:46,320
Our men just sent word back.

486
00:37:46,599 --> 00:37:48,440
Qin Mu has already returned to Country M.

487
00:37:48,840 --> 00:37:50,079
Yesterday, a Chinese man

488
00:37:50,400 --> 00:37:51,440
went to Qin Mu's place looking for him.

489
00:37:52,199 --> 00:37:54,280
I'm guessing that was Li Qiang.

490
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:57,199
Still no sign of Ma Jingrong, though.

491
00:38:02,039 --> 00:38:02,599
Brother Dong.

492
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:03,320
Brother Dong.

493
00:38:08,639 --> 00:38:09,760
You were special forces?

494
00:38:10,199 --> 00:38:10,559
Yes.

495
00:38:14,159 --> 00:38:15,599
I don't keep freeloaders here.

496
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:17,239
If you've really got what it takes,

497
00:38:17,559 --> 00:38:18,400
you can stay.

498
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:19,960
Clouded Leopard.

499
00:38:20,320 --> 00:38:20,920
Boss.

500
00:38:22,559 --> 00:38:24,320
Clouded Leopard is my best fighter.

501
00:38:25,760 --> 00:38:27,119
If you can take him down,

502
00:38:29,519 --> 00:38:30,480
you're my brother.

503
00:38:30,599 --> 00:38:31,239
Three minutes.

504
00:38:32,079 --> 00:38:33,360
If you win,

505
00:38:33,639 --> 00:38:35,239
you can stay and work for me.

506
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:36,880
If not,

507
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:42,159
you don't get to stay.

508
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:46,639
Three minutes.

509
00:38:47,679 --> 00:38:49,599
What's wrong? Scared?

510
00:38:50,719 --> 00:38:51,360
If you don't have the guts,

511
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,039
stay and pay for my brother's life.

512
00:39:00,360 --> 00:39:00,960
Begin.

513
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:47,960
Time's up.

514
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,400
Looks like you lost.

515
00:40:09,119 --> 00:40:10,719
There are many ways to subdue someone.

516
00:40:11,159 --> 00:40:12,480
You don't always have to use your fists.

517
00:40:15,679 --> 00:40:18,159
Clouded Leopard, I always say

518
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:21,079
fists can't solve everything.

519
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,840
If you keep acting like this,

520
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:24,960
you'll get yourself killed sooner or later.

521
00:40:28,079 --> 00:40:29,159
Four-Legged Snake is right.

522
00:40:29,519 --> 00:40:30,559
You're a capable man.

523
00:40:32,239 --> 00:40:33,400
Take him with you to Country M.

524
00:40:33,559 --> 00:40:36,000
Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu must both die.

525
00:40:44,079 --> 00:40:46,119
We successfully fooled Ma Jingrong this time.

526
00:40:46,559 --> 00:40:49,679
I believe Jiang Liye and Theerade

527
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:50,960
will take the bait soon.

528
00:40:52,159 --> 00:40:53,559
Operation Thunderbolt

529
00:40:54,159 --> 00:40:56,480
can finally close in on the biggest tiger.

530
00:40:58,039 --> 00:41:00,119
Theerade's gang power in Country M

531
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:01,840
might not match the Four Families,

532
00:41:02,000 --> 00:41:03,360
but you still need to be careful.

533
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:05,079
Protect yourselves.

534
00:41:06,239 --> 00:41:06,800
Understood.

535
00:41:07,639 --> 00:41:09,360
Ma Jingrong completely trusts me now.

536
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:10,960
As for Theerade,

537
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:12,599
I introduced him

538
00:41:12,760 --> 00:41:14,039
to a major buyer like Shen Xinru.

539
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,760
He can't thank me enough.

540
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:18,679
Now we finally have the chance

541
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:20,039
to catch this big tiger.

542
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:23,440
Inspector Mai sent word today.

543
00:41:24,400 --> 00:41:26,039
His informant planted near Qin Mu

544
00:41:26,039 --> 00:41:26,840
has already confirmed

545
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:30,079
that Li Qiang tracked down Qin Mu two days ago.

546
00:41:30,360 --> 00:41:32,960
If you run into Li Qiang back in Country M,

547
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:35,519
all our efforts will go down the drain.

548
00:41:43,360 --> 00:41:45,519
We'll cross that bridge when we get to it.

549
00:41:47,559 --> 00:41:48,559
What other choice is there?

550
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:52,280
Don't worry.

551
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:56,639
Before coming here, I already worked out

552
00:41:56,800 --> 00:41:58,079
an action plan with Inspector Mai.

553
00:41:58,199 --> 00:41:59,519
He will coordinate with Country M's police

554
00:41:59,679 --> 00:42:01,280
under the guise of fighting illegal entry

555
00:42:01,679 --> 00:42:02,920
to launch a secret operation

556
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:05,000
to capture Li Qiang and rescue Tian Xin.

557
00:42:06,360 --> 00:42:08,400
By the time you return to Country M,

558
00:42:08,599 --> 00:42:10,840
Li Qiang should already be extradited back.

559
00:42:14,199 --> 00:42:16,320
Once Tian Xin is saved from Li Qiang,

560
00:42:16,480 --> 00:42:17,440
the heavy burden on Li Xiao's mind

561
00:42:17,440 --> 00:42:18,320
can finally be lifted.

562
00:42:19,559 --> 00:42:22,199
I hope the two can reunite soon.

563
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:26,079
What is Li Xiao doing right now?

564
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:28,280
Li Xiao has located Professor Du.

565
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:29,400
He's being held by Piyazi

566
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:31,960
in a border town within our country.

567
00:42:32,079 --> 00:42:33,320
The police will send

568
00:42:33,320 --> 00:42:34,559
a special task force

569
00:42:34,719 --> 00:42:36,639
led by Li Xiao to rescue him.

570
00:42:40,159 --> 00:42:43,039
Operation Thunderbolt is in its final stage.

571
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:44,679
The dawn is just ahead.

572
00:42:45,119 --> 00:42:47,280
Please give it your all, everyone.

573
00:42:48,519 --> 00:42:49,480
Yes, sir!

574
00:42:50,199 --> 00:42:52,280
Director Huang, let me give you a briefing.

575
00:42:52,800 --> 00:42:54,559
According to the Economic Crimes Division,

576
00:42:54,880 --> 00:42:57,599
many wire transfers from Longze Group

577
00:42:57,800 --> 00:42:58,960
suspected of money laundering

578
00:42:59,159 --> 00:43:01,159
were actually signed and authorized

579
00:43:01,400 --> 00:43:03,159
by Executive Chairman Jiang Shan.

580
00:43:03,480 --> 00:43:06,079
Along Longze Group's laundering chain,

581
00:43:06,239 --> 00:43:07,559
we found three companies

582
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:09,679
registered under Jiang Shan's relatives.

583
00:43:11,960 --> 00:43:13,400
Jiangyang police have obtained

584
00:43:13,519 --> 00:43:14,440
Cheng Weimin's confession.

585
00:43:14,840 --> 00:43:16,280
According to Cheng Weimin,

586
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:19,559
the one moving drugs via Zhongtian Logistics

587
00:43:19,679 --> 00:43:21,760
wasn't Chen Hai, but Jiang Shan.

588
00:43:22,159 --> 00:43:24,159
Chen Hai was merely a pawn used by Jiang Shan

589
00:43:24,320 --> 00:43:26,760
in the drug transit and laundering lines.

590
00:43:27,440 --> 00:43:29,320
Jiang Shan thought killing Chen Hai

591
00:43:29,480 --> 00:43:30,519
would cover up his tracks completely.

592
00:43:30,800 --> 00:43:31,760
What he didn't expect was

593
00:43:32,039 --> 00:43:33,440
that we would obtain

594
00:43:33,440 --> 00:43:34,599
ironclad evidence so quickly.

595
00:43:35,599 --> 00:43:37,199
After Hu Dong died,

596
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:39,280
Jiang Shan's brother, Jiang Hua,

597
00:43:39,480 --> 00:43:41,039
took over as the head

598
00:43:41,239 --> 00:43:42,519
of Longze Group's security.

599
00:43:42,880 --> 00:43:43,960
Right now, this Jiang Hua

600
00:43:44,119 --> 00:43:45,920
is in frequent contact with local drug figures

601
00:43:46,039 --> 00:43:47,000
and criminal syndicates.

602
00:43:47,320 --> 00:43:48,559
He meets with them all the time.

603
00:43:48,960 --> 00:43:51,400
So we suspect Jiang Shan

604
00:43:51,599 --> 00:43:53,400
might be attempting to rebuild

605
00:43:53,559 --> 00:43:56,159
his drug distribution network in our city.

606
00:43:57,719 --> 00:43:59,360
Our suspicions about Jiang Shan

607
00:43:59,559 --> 00:44:00,800
are now backed by solid evidence.

608
00:44:01,360 --> 00:44:02,679
Let's work out an arrest plan

609
00:44:02,840 --> 00:44:05,039
to bust Jiang Shan and his men as soon as possible.

610
00:44:05,119 --> 00:44:06,239
Understood. Yes, sir.
